# TC005 - Update Product Quantity in Cart Successfully


## Test Scenario
Update the quantity of a product already added to the shopping cart.


## Objective
Validate that the system allows the user to modify the quantity of products already added to the cart and updates the total correctly.


## Preconditions
User has a product already added to the cart.

URL: https://automationexercise.com/products


## Test Steps
1. Navigate to the Products page  
2. Select a product from the list  
3. Click on "ADD TO CART"  
4. Click on "View Cart"  
5. Locate the quantity field in the cart  
6. Update the product quantity value  


## Expected Result
The system should allow the user to update the product quantity in the cart and reflect the updated value correctly.


## Actual Result
The system allowed the user to update the quantity of the product in the cart successfully, and the cart reflected the updated quantity correctly.


## Status
Passed


